es have already been performed. source-bound-joining-trial concerns Lin's nominated vine and branches and loose wrapping, not this specimen or a rain-screen load test; sol-birch-container-feasibility concerns a different material and purpose. Their incomplete schemas do not establish functional equivalence or authorize transplanting their physical assumptions. Reuse their applicable implementation machinery after full-schema comparison in the handoff, recording exact reused revisions rather than claiming reinvention. Present facts support an assessment with explicit observation limits, not a strength test or completed screen.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Implement Assess(specimenId=item-279-sol-1666,evidenceRefs=[]), bound to the exact live whole branch, owner Sol, origin start-1-branches and harvestedAt 279. No source stock lookup or further gathering is part of this action. Require Sol alive, the actual unreserved branch locally accessible, sufficient energy and no conflicting manipulation. Carried inventory is local; recorded coordinates alone do not permit remote manipulation. Accept at most eight exact complete personally available evidence records; absent or partial records remain unavailable, and no private knowledge is fetched from another actor. Study costs one active round and 0.2 energy; assessment costs one active round and 0.5 energy. No tool, consumable, travel, water, covering, fastener, anchorage or external support is supplied or consumed. Assessment is gentle viewing and, only if the represented handling constraints permit it, nondamaging reorientation without lifting an unsupported heavy object. It applies no added test load, bending, breaking, overhead placement, standing structure or exposure beneath a branch. If safe handling is unsupported, observe in place and report that limit.\\\\nUse the existing actual branch representation only. Quantity 1 does not establish a single useful span, length, diameter, straightness, fork geometry, mass, stiffness, rot, load capacity or suitability for a screen. Source-marker geometry is not specimen geometry. Observe and record only properties genuinely supported by an accessible specimen model or rendering; distinguish model assumptions, direct findings, supplied evidence, unavailable properties and construction requirements. Do not import hazelnut geometry or turn resource labels or accounting units into measurements. With the present evidence, an executable outcome may be a dated report that dimensions and mechanical response are unavailable. This is a legitimate precursor, not an implicit failed construction or permanent refusal.\\\\nThe report identifies which of actual dimensions and condition, safely usable contact/support points, a load-response model, an acquired covering with relevant mass and rain behavior, attachment method, stable anchorage and site conditions are unresolved for the proposed small rain screen. These are unresolved prerequisites, not a claim that any particular construction method or material is mandatory. Do not reserve, acquire or fabricate those inputs automatically. Missing source-appropriate geometry or response mechanisms go to this same development handoff. Compare the full source-bound-joining-trial and sol-birch-container-feasibility implementations before introducing duplicate assessment, conservation, reporting or event code; record reused code IDs and revisions and any genuinely new branch-source adapter. No individual mastery is inherited.\\\\nThis first release authorizes no physical strength trial. Any subsequently implemented bounded trial must, before execution and payment, expose an exact executable quote naming the same branch and current state, actual acquired load and support identities, support geometry and ground clearance, maximum load and duration, application/removal method, actor exclusion region, observable displacement/damage limits, stopping rules, energy/time/material and wear costs, response model revision and complete fragment accounting if damage is possible. Unknown safe load or support is a reason not to execute that trial, not permission to choose an arbitrary load. A failed or unavailable trial must remain failed or unavailable. No shelter, rain protection, comfort, strength certificate or new branch is produced by assessment.\\\\nOn atomic assessment commit, create an append-only private report and observable assessment-completed event with unique IDs, actual execution tick/location, actor and specimen references, source/model/code revisions, canonical observed-state fingerprint, performed method, exact usable evidence citations, findings and unresolved prerequisites. The date is the execution tick, not automatically tick 279. Preserve branch identity, quantity, ownership, position and condition; no fragments or hidden material transfers, and ordinary ageing continues. No physical marker is spawned merely for the report. Invalid access or insufficient energy fails before payment. Cancellation, interruption or death before atomic commit gives no report and no assessment charge; completed effort is not refunded. There is no partial work, escrow, automatic resume, ongoing work or maintenance. A later invocation is a newly validated paid assessment, not free completion or automatic refresh. Study progress uses the established learning ledger: interrupted paid study is retained without duplicating charges; cancellation/death creates no mastery or refund of completed effort. Development and review waiting advance neither world time nor work. Reports are not automatically communicated; any exchange requires an actual independent participant's action. Established checks and outcomes must execute in code without repeated model adjudication.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Assess functional findings, experience and appearance separately. This precursor grants no automatic pleasure, satisfaction, practice, comfort, energy recovery or nutrition benefit. Requesting, studying, naming, report creation, unavailable-mechanism notices and repeated known findings earn zero. A genuinely new, personally applicable supported physical observation, including an informative actual failed test in a later authorized implementation, may invoke only the existing grounded-understanding rule if present: short amount 0.8, cap 1, duration 8 rounds, cooldown 12, maintained increment 0.035 and decay 0.0015 under that rule's existing limits and maintenance conditions. Otherwise award zero; do not create a replacement reward account. Deduplicate by specimen lineage, property, method and relevant state across all functionally equivalent abilities; superficial relabeling or another report cannot reset eligibility. No passive satisfaction accumulation, comfort claim or basic-nutrition reduction is permitted. Physical comfort remains bounded by 10 globally. Never alter protected reward accounts, budget, goals or permissions.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Use reusable event/report metadata containing eventId, reportId, actorId, specimenId, location, tick, method, source/model revision, supported-property statuses, progress and outcome. An assessment-completed status means only that observation/reporting finished, not that a branch passed a load test. Retain the actual item's available rendering; do not invent dimensions, straightness, reinforcement, cracks, attachments, a covering or a standing shelter. If no specimen geometry is available, a neutral report indicator may say 'geometry unavailable; no load test performed' without substituting a physical branch mesh as evidence. Failed validation emits only a failure status, not a completed observation or success animation. Any later trial must render real applied load, supported placement, deformation or failure only from committed physical events, with a separate untested/paused/failed/passed-for-stated-load outcome. Detailed findings remain private until actual communication; no omniscient displ